= Establishment of the Guangzhou Nationalist Government

After Chen Jiongming's defeat and the death of Sun Yat-sen, we have finally begun to reform our old system in Canton.

The *Army and Navy Marshal Stronghold*, established after the Guangzhou Government's defeat against Yuan Shikai is aging, and we have sought to apply Sun Yat-sen's ideas of government.

We have now established the Five-Power System, with it's branches, the Executive, Legislative, Judicial, Examination and Control Yuans. With the Chairman of the Nationalist Government elected by our own Central Executive Commitee.
The Legislative Yuan's president is also chosen by the CEC, and heads the main legislative body of the government.

This is a great milestone for our party and strengthens our position against the Beiyang Government.
